{{Headline|22|In Other News}}

*The PvP rota is switching over to [https://www.runescape.com/oldschool/pvpworldrota Period B].
*An issue where players were unable to perform a special attack on a player in multi that had recently been hit by another player's special attack has been fixed.
*The Wilderness level information has been re-positioned to avoid overlapping interfaces on mobile.
*When interfaces such as the poll booth would overlap with tabs such as the inventory, the tabs are closed automatically by default but can be opened again.
*Mirrors are now correctly displayed when looking into them during the Desert Treasure quest on mobile.
*Spirit trees now use the correct chathead when attempting to travel to a location that you're already at.
*The drop rate for elite clues from Theatre of Blood has been adjusted.
*A grammar error in Kolodion's dialogue for Mage Arena II has been fixed.

The following fixes have been made for issues with the chatbox resulting from last week's changes:
*All functionality to sections of the chat box options have been restored.
*The configure filter can now once again be toggled.
*Auto-chat can once again be paused.

